OpenHDK is a clean modernization line inspired by HandyKaraoke:
https://github.com/sc28249782/HandyKaraoke

This bootstrap contains no source files copied from HandyKaraoke and no
BASS-family SDK files.

If HandyKaraoke source is ported later, retain every applicable copyright and
GPL notice. Each port must identify its upstream path, revision, modification
date, and substantive OpenHDK changes.

BASS, BASS FX, BASSMIDI, BASSmix, and BASS_VST are not dependencies.
